  "limits": [
    "Independent acceptance remains pending; this is implementation evidence, not Phase08/public GO",
    "Quarantine trusts PostgreSQL superusers and the operator controlling role/ACL changes; the recovery owner is deliberately not shareable even via inert membership",
    "Abnormal backup cleanup requires the reviewed disposable container tmpfs boundary and restart policy; a bare host process restarter is not a substitute",
    "Actual kernel OOM was not induced; real child SIGKILL exercised abrupt child death, container restart, tmpfs removal and subsequent successful retry",
    "Off-host copy/key escrow/external alerts/native ARM/full browser-vault-object recovery remain separate unverified gates",
    "No dependency changes or fresh production audit in this fix; previous audit evidence retained"
